      "note": "Consumes the attacker-controlled PoC buffer through ASN1 public key decoding. The ASN1 entry binding at line 277 (sc_format_asn1_entry(asn1_rsakey_value_choice + 1, &der->value, &der->len, 0)) directs the decoder to store the 'direct' RSA key value into der->value, which aliases obj->content.value (der = &obj->content at line 220). asn1_decode_entry at asn1.c:1504 mallocs a 2-byte buffer and stores its address in obj->content.value. The overall decode then returns a negative error code because the PoC is malformed.",
